# Project Structure Guide

- The main entry point is [lib/main.dart](mdc:lib/main.dart), which initializes dependencies in [lib/core/ioc.dart](mdc:lib/core/ioc.dart) and sets up the app theme and home page.
- State management uses the Bloc/Cubit pattern, with key cubits in [lib/core/cubit/](mdc:lib/core/cubit), [lib/home_page/presentation/cubit/](mdc:lib/home_page/presentation/cubit), and [lib/settings/cubit/](mdc:lib/settings/cubit).
- The home screen is implemented in [lib/home_page/presentation/pages/home_page.dart](mdc:lib/home_page/presentation/pages/home_page.dart), which uses [DvarmalchusCubit](mdc:lib/home_page/presentation/cubit/dvarmalchus_cubit.dart) for business logic and state.
- API and networking are handled by [lib/core/rest_client.dart](mdc:lib/core/rest_client.dart), with data models in [lib/core/network/response/](mdc:lib/core/network/response).
- App-wide constants and colors are defined in [lib/core/constants/constants.dart](mdc:lib/core/constants/constants.dart).
- Additional features and pages are in [lib/hashlamot/](mdc:lib/hashlamot), [lib/credits/](mdc:lib/credits), and [lib/settings/](mdc:lib/settings).
- Tests are located in [test/](mdc:test).

