# Project Structure Pattern

- Every page has its own directory, and inside it, its own cubits (state management logic). For example, the home page and its cubit are under `lib/home_page/presentation/pages/` and `lib/home_page/presentation/cubit/` respectively. The settings page and its cubit are under `lib/settings/` and `lib/settings/cubit/`.
- This pattern is followed throughout the project for modularity and separation of concerns.
- Core logic, shared resources, and reusable cubits are in the `core/` directory.
- Additional features like credits and hashlamot have their own directories.